      <rules>
        <rule id="4dec8d66-4d1c-4e1b-9dee-73ccd1bac9d6" name="Jury-Rigged [Speed]" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of its activation, this model can spend 1 focus point to use Jury-Rigged. This model gains +2 SPD this activation. At the end of this activation, it suffers 1 damage point to its first available Movement system box. This model cannot use Jury-Rigged if its Movement system is crippled. Jury-Rigged can be used only once per activation.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
