          <rules>
            <rule id="60d4-77e1-e24b-712b" name="Ammo Type" hidden="false">
              <description>Each time this weapon is uised to make an attack, choose one of the folowing abilities:
- Crater- The AOE is rough terrain and remains in play for one round.
- Quake - On a direct hit against an enemy model, all models hit are knocked down.</description>
            </rule>
