              <rules>
                <rule id="c6dd-dce7-ba6e-8754" name="Scattershot (* Attack)" hidden="false">
                  <description>To make a Scattershot special attack, Herne and Jonne must be B2B. Make a normal attack with this weapon. After determining point of impact for that attack, roll deviation for two additional 3&quot; AOEs centered on that point. Models in an AOE are hit and suffer a POW 7 blast damage roll.</description>
