      <rules>
        <rule id="452086a4-35d2-ae89-4f6f-1fdf73036e65" name="Affinity [Damiano]" hidden="false">
          <description>While in Damiano&apos;s control area, this model gains Quick Work. (When a model with Quick Work destroys one or more enemy models with a melee attack during its combat action, immediately after the attack is resolved it can make one normal ranged attack. Attacks gained from Quick Work do not count against a weapon&apos;s ROF.)</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
