      <rules>
        <rule id="07136a5b-5425-530a-cee3-ba3794aac858" name="Arcane Secrets (* Action)" publicationId="5382cf4f--pubN70293" page="135" hidden="false">
          <description>RNG 3. Target this model&apos;s warcaster. If the warcaster is in range, it gains an additional die on magic attack and magic damage rolls for the next spell it casts. Discard the lowest die in each roll. Arcane Secrets lasts for one turn.</description>
        </rule>
