        <rule id="8643-2bdb-f23a-7162" name="Unstoppable Force" hidden="false">
          <description>While in ths model&apos;s control area, models in its battlegroup gain Bulldoze. Unstoppable Force lasts for one turn. (When a model with Bulldoze advances into B2B contact with an enemy model during its activation, it can push that model up to 2&quot; directly away from it. A model can be pushed by Bulldoze only once per activation. Bulldoze has no effect when this model makes a trample power attack.)</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
