      <rules>
        <rule id="c3eb-3a83-5a0b-656d" name="Veil of Mists" hidden="false">
          <description>Place a 4&quot; AOE cloud effect anywhere completely in this model&apos;s control area. This AOE does not block friendly Faction models&apos; LOS. While in the AOE, friendly Faction models gain Pathfinder and can move through obstructions and other models if they have enough movement to move completely past them.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
