          <description>This model cannot make ranged attacks, and non-magical ranged attacks targeting it automatically miss. While completely within 3&quot; of this model, models cannot make ranged attacks and non-magical ranged attacks targeting them automatically miss. Wind Wall lasts for one round.</description>
